    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44035" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθῠ-δῐκία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>direct trial</i>, on the
			merits of the case, without exceptions or technical pleas, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυδικίας ἀποδέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					7.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσιέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					34.4
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυδικίᾳ εἰσιέναι,
				εἰσελθεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				45.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.43
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐξ εὐθυδικίας λόγον
				συνίστασθαι</span> Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				31 vi 13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
